# Two families of nine functions, more than a set holds. The program calls the second and never the first. The functions of the first stay unreached: no unit is compiled whose effects name no write.
# OPTIONS: check=Validate
# RUN: compile mechanisms=all
# CHECK-NOT: EffectsNotCounted
# RUN(FUNCTIONS): link functions mechanisms=all
# FUNCTIONS: function f3 unreached
# RUN(ANSWERS): run-in-shell
# ANSWERS: 81 72 1 2
